{"id":"b93c21fedffb4c4c","group":"56","path":"56/56-df-proofterm-substitution.md","title":"项模式在证明项中的实例化","display":"df-proofterm-substitution — 项模式在证明项中的实例化","type":"definition","metadata":{"type":"definition","book":"Term Rewriting Systems (Terese, 2003)","book_abbrev":"56","label":"56-df-proofterm-substitution","aliases":["56-df-proofterm-substitution"],"display":"df-proofterm-substitution — 项模式在证明项中的实例化","depends_on":["[[56-df-proofterm]]","[[56-df-substitution-application]]"],"source_section":"§8.2 Notation 8.2.19; §8.3 Table 8.2","source_printed_pages":"323,329–330","source_ocr_blocks":[344,350,351],"source_statement_status":"compared-to-local-djvu-ocr; typed-open-term-coding-local","source_proof_status":"local-structural-derivation-in-Remark; not-machine-formalized"},"metadataError":null,"renderWarnings":[],"properties":[{"key":"type","html":"definition"},{"key":"book","html":"Term Rewriting Systems (Terese, 2003)"},{"key":"book_abbrev","html":"56"},{"key":"label","html":"56-df-proofterm-substitution"},{"key":"aliases","html":"<div class=\"property-array\"><span>56-df-proofterm-substitution</span></div>"},{"key":"display","html":"df-proofterm-substitution — 项模式在证明项中的实例化"},{"key":"depends_on","html":"<div class=\"property-array\"><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-1\" data-note=\"fd4c46cdc1516501\" href=\"?note=fd4c46cdc1516501\" title=\"56-df-proofterm\">56-df-proofterm</a></span><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-2\" data-note=\"6aa7f56f36c897f4\" href=\"?note=6aa7f56f36c897f4\" title=\"56-df-substitution-application\">56-df-substitution-application</a></span></div>"},{"key":"source_section","html":"§8.2 Notation 8.2.19; §8.3 Table 8.2"},{"key":"source_printed_pages","html":"323,329–330"},{"key":"source_ocr_blocks","html":"<div class=\"property-array\"><span>344</span><span>350</span><span>351</span></div>"},{"key":"source_statement_status","html":"compared-to-local-djvu-ocr; typed-open-term-coding-local"},{"key":"source_proof_status","html":"local-structural-derivation-in-Remark; not-machine-formalized"}],"html":"\n<h2 id=\"Hypothesis\">[Hypothesis]</h2>\n<p>使用 <a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-3\" data-note=\"fd4c46cdc1516501\" href=\"?note=fd4c46cdc1516501\" title=\"56-df-proofterm\">56-df-proofterm</a> 的类型化证明项。<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\theta:V\\to\\operatorname{PT}_R\">\\(\\theta:V\\to\\operatorname{PT}_R\\)</span>，<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"q\\in T\">\\(q\\in T\\)</span>。<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"S_R\\theta,T_R\\theta\">\\(S_R\\theta,T_R\\theta\\)</span> 是下文定义的变量替换，项上的应用见 <a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-4\" data-note=\"6aa7f56f36c897f4\" href=\"?note=6aa7f56f36c897f4\" title=\"56-df-substitution-application\">56-df-substitution-application</a>。规则实例化的两个定义式局部取 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\lambda=(l,r)\\in R\">\\(\\lambda=(l,r)\\in R\\)</span>、<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\boldsymbol\\phi\\in\\operatorname{PT}_R^{k_\\lambda}\">\\(\\boldsymbol\\phi\\in\\operatorname{PT}_R^{k_\\lambda}\\)</span>；一般的 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\widehat\\theta\">\\(\\widehat\\theta\\)</span>、<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"S_R\\theta\">\\(S_R\\theta\\)</span>、<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"T_R\\theta\">\\(T_R\\theta\\)</span> 独立以已给定的 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\theta\">\\(\\theta\\)</span> 为参数。</p>\n<h2 id=\"Assertion\">[Assertion]</h2>\n<figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"(S_R\\theta)(x)\\coloneqq S_R(\\theta(x)),\\qquad(T_R\\theta)(x)\\coloneqq T_R(\\theta(x))\\quad(x\\in V).\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[(S_R\\theta)(x)\\coloneqq S_R(\\theta(x)),\\qquad(T_R\\theta)(x)\\coloneqq T_R(\\theta(x))\\quad(x\\in V).\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\widehat\\theta(x)\\coloneqq\\theta(x),\\qquad\\widehat\\theta(f(q_1,\\ldots,q_n))\\coloneqq\\mathsf F(f;\\widehat\\theta(q_1),\\ldots,\\widehat\\theta(q_n)).\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\widehat\\theta(x)\\coloneqq\\theta(x),\\qquad\\widehat\\theta(f(q_1,\\ldots,q_n))\\coloneqq\\mathsf F(f;\\widehat\\theta(q_1),\\ldots,\\widehat\\theta(q_n)).\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\theta_{\\lambda,\\boldsymbol\\phi}(x)\\coloneqq\\begin{cases}\\phi_i&amp;x=x_{\\lambda,i},\\\\\\operatorname{Id}_R(x)&amp;x\\notin\\operatorname{Var}(l).\\end{cases}\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\theta_{\\lambda,\\boldsymbol\\phi}(x)\\coloneqq\\begin{cases}\\phi_i&amp;x=x_{\\lambda,i},\\\\\\operatorname{Id}_R(x)&amp;x\\notin\\operatorname{Var}(l).\\end{cases}\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"q\\langle\\boldsymbol\\phi\\rangle_\\lambda\\coloneqq\\widehat{\\theta_{\\lambda,\\boldsymbol\\phi}}(q).\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[q\\langle\\boldsymbol\\phi\\rangle_\\lambda\\coloneqq\\widehat{\\theta_{\\lambda,\\boldsymbol\\phi}}(q).\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\widehat\\theta(q)\\in\\operatorname{PT}_R,\\qquad S_R(\\widehat\\theta(q))=q(S_R\\theta),\\qquad T_R(\\widehat\\theta(q))=q(T_R\\theta).\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\widehat\\theta(q)\\in\\operatorname{PT}_R,\\qquad S_R(\\widehat\\theta(q))=q(S_R\\theta),\\qquad T_R(\\widehat\\theta(q))=q(T_R\\theta).\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><h2 id=\"Remark\">[Remark]</h2>\n<p>对q结构归纳即验证最后一式的类型和端点。这里实例化的对象是普通项模式，不是在任意证明树中任意改写变量。模式中的重复变量会复制同一子证明；右项没有的变量会删除该证明。这正是置换方程能够表达复制和删除的原因。</p>\n<p>来源：用户提供的Terese (2003)本地DjVu；书页为印刷页，OCR块按U+001F从1编号。源文件及规范化文字哈希已与前轮重核。</p>\n","headings":[{"id":"Hypothesis","text":"[Hypothesis]","level":2},{"id":"Assertion","text":"[Assertion]","level":2},{"id":"Remark","text":"[Remark]","level":2}],"links":[{"target":"56-df-proofterm","status":"resolved","id":"fd4c46cdc1516501","anchor":"ref-1","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[56-df-proofterm]]","embed":false},{"target":"56-df-substitution-application","status":"resolved","id":"6aa7f56f36c897f4","anchor":"ref-2","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[56-df-substitution-application]]","embed":false},{"target":"56-df-proofterm","status":"resolved","id":"fd4c46cdc1516501","anchor":"ref-3","targetAnchor":"","location":"正文","heading":"[Hypothesis]","excerpt":"使用 [[56-df-proofterm]] 的类型化证明项。$\\theta:V\\to\\operatorname{PT}_R$，$q\\in T$。$S_R\\theta,T_R\\theta$ 是下文定义的变量替换，项上的应用见 [[56-df-substitution-application]]。规则实例化的两个定义式局部取 $\\lambda=(l,r)\\in R$、$\\boldsymbol\\phi\\in\\operatorname{PT}_R^{k_\\lambda}$；一般的 $\\widehat\\theta$、$S_R\\theta$、$T_R\\theta$ 独立以已给定的 $\\theta$ 为参数。","embed":false},{"target":"56-df-substitution-application","status":"resolved","id":"6aa7f56f36c897f4","anchor":"ref-4","targetAnchor":"","location":"正文","heading":"[Hypothesis]","excerpt":"使用 [[56-df-proofterm]] 的类型化证明项。$\\theta:V\\to\\operatorname{PT}_R$，$q\\in T$。$S_R\\theta,T_R\\theta$ 是下文定义的变量替换，项上的应用见 [[56-df-substitution-application]]。规则实例化的两个定义式局部取 $\\lambda=(l,r)\\in R$、$\\boldsymbol\\phi\\in\\operatorname{PT}_R^{k_\\lambda}$；一般的 $\\widehat\\theta$、$S_R\\theta$、$T_R\\theta$ 独立以已给定的 $\\theta$ 为参数。","embed":false}],"attachments":[],"math":[{"tex":"\\theta:V\\to\\operatorname{PT}_R","display":false},{"tex":"q\\in T","display":false},{"tex":"S_R\\theta,T_R\\theta","display":false},{"tex":"\\lambda=(l,r)\\in R","display":false},{"tex":"\\boldsymbol\\phi\\in\\operatorname{PT}_R^{k_\\lambda}","display":false},{"tex":"\\widehat\\theta","display":false},{"tex":"S_R\\theta","display":false},{"tex":"T_R\\theta","display":false},{"tex":"\\theta","display":false},{"tex":"(S_R\\theta)(x)\\coloneqq S_R(\\theta(x)),\\qquad(T_R\\theta)(x)\\coloneqq T_R(\\theta(x))\\quad(x\\in V).","display":true},{"tex":"\\widehat\\theta(x)\\coloneqq\\theta(x),\\qquad\\widehat\\theta(f(q_1,\\ldots,q_n))\\coloneqq\\mathsf F(f;\\widehat\\theta(q_1),\\ldots,\\widehat\\theta(q_n)).","display":true},{"tex":"\\theta_{\\lambda,\\boldsymbol\\phi}(x)\\coloneqq\\begin{cases}\\phi_i&x=x_{\\lambda,i},\\\\\\operatorname{Id}_R(x)&x\\notin\\operatorname{Var}(l).\\end{cases}","display":true},{"tex":"q\\langle\\boldsymbol\\phi\\rangle_\\lambda\\coloneqq\\widehat{\\theta_{\\lambda,\\boldsymbol\\phi}}(q).","display":true},{"tex":"\\widehat\\theta(q)\\in\\operatorname{PT}_R,\\qquad S_R(\\widehat\\theta(q))=q(S_R\\theta),\\qquad T_R(\\widehat\\theta(q))=q(T_R\\theta).","display":true}],"bytes":2265,"backlinks":[{"id":"3d6e0e629b7557a3","anchor":"ref-4","locations":["元数据 · depends_on","正文"],"count":2,"excerpt":"使用 [[56-df-levy-rule-lifting]] 的左线性系统与 [[56-df-proofterm-substitution]] 的证明项构造器；在 $R^L$ 中每个 $\\lambda^L(\\ell)$ 沿用 $\\lambda$ 的变量枚举。各递归分支仅取下文定义的域 $\\mathcal P_R^L$ 中的输入；函数构造分支有 $\\hat s=c(\\hat s_1,\\ldots,\\hat s_n)$、$\\operatorname{er}_L(c)=f$；规则构造分支有 $\\lambda=(l,r)$，$\\ell=\\operatorname{Skel}_R(\\hat s,(\\epsilon,l,r))$，$\\hat\\sigma=\\operatorname{Match}_R^L(\\hat s,(\\epsilon,l,r))$。"},{"id":"001b6ab17e88507e","anchor":"ref-2","locations":["元数据 · depends_on","正文"],"count":2,"excerpt":"使用 [[56-df-proofterm-substitution]]。下列各方程仅在所有组合均类型化时取实例。$\\square$ 是异于证明树构造标签的新孔符号。原始一孔证明树上下文 $K$ 的孔填入记作 $K[\\zeta]$，其中 $\\zeta\\in\\mathcal Q_R$；填孔、闭包算子与生成关系均在下文定义。$B\\subseteq\\operatorname{PT}_R^2$，$\\phi,\\psi,\\chi\\in\\operatorname{PT}_R$。规则构造及I/O方程分支局部取 $\\lambda=(l,r)\\in R$；各方程中的 $\\phi_i:s_i\\to t_i$ 表示 $S_R(\\phi_i)=s_i,T_R(\\phi_i)=t_i$，不是额外归约关系。"},{"id":"7a89e84aacc9537c","anchor":"ref-113","locations":["正文"],"count":2,"excerpt":"[[56-df-proofterm-substitution.md]]"}],"outgoing":["fd4c46cdc1516501","6aa7f56f36c897f4"]}